{"availability":"available","full":"uday-a/next-boilerplate","name":"next-boilerplate","description":"Next.js 16 SaaS boilerplate & starter kit: React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, shadcn/ui-compatible @uipkge-react UI. GitHub OAuth + magic-link auth, Polar billing, Drizzle ORM + Postgres, admin RBAC, team invites, API keys, audit log, next-intl i18n, dashboard with charts, kanban & data table. Every integration env-gated.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":24,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-18T03:38:44Z","updated":"2026-10-05T03:26:03Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next-boilerplate-sooty.vercel.app","topics":["admin-dashboard","app-router","authentication","boilerplate","dashboard","drizzle-orm","next-intl","nextjs","nextjs16","polar","rbac","react","react19","saas","saas-boilerplate","shadcn-ui","starter-kit","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://next-boilerplate-sooty.vercel.app/login","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.824Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.824Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.824Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.824Z","stars":24,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-grade Next.js 16 SaaS boilerplate / starter kit (App Router) with React 19, TypeScript and Tailwind CSS 4, built on the shadcn/ui-compatible @uipkge-react UI registry. It ships GitHub OAuth + magic-link authentication, Polar billing, a Drizzle ORM + Postgres schema, an admin area with role-based access control (RBAC), team invites, API keys, an audit log, i18n with next-intl, and a full dashboard (charts, kanban, data table, calendar). Every external integration is gated on env, so a fresh clone runs in demo mode with no database, OAuth app or API keys.","Live demo · Vue/Nuxt sibling: nuxt-boilerplate · SvelteKit sibling: sveltekit-boilerplate · Angular sibling: angular-boilerplate · UI registry: uipkge.dev"],"features":["Auth: GitHub OAuth, passwordless magic links, demo sign-in, encrypted iron-session cookies, team invites by token","Billing: Polar checkout, customer portal and signature-verified subscription webhooks","Database: Drizzle ORM + Postgres — users, projects, subscriptions, API keys, audit log, invites","Admin & RBAC: admin / editor / user roles enforced server-side, admin user list, permission-matrix UI","Dashboard: KPIs, ECharts charts, Leaflet map, kanban, TanStack data table, calendar, messages, activity heatmap"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uday-a/next-boilerplate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"247c8457d4efd9c38d0352d48d0518da488a4e1133bf3b276369e0b1c77c17a0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.961Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:43:53.961Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A production-grade Next.js 16 SaaS boilerplate / starter kit (App Router) with React 19, TypeScript and Tailwind CSS 4, built on the shadcn/ui-compatible @uipkge-react UI registry. It ships GitHub OAuth + magic-link authentication, Polar billing, a Drizzle ORM + Postgres schema, an admin area with role-based access control (RBAC), team invites, API keys, an audit log, i18n with next-intl, and a full dashboard (charts, kanban, data table, calendar). Every external integration is gated on env, so a fresh clone runs in demo mode with no database, OAuth app or API keys.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uday-a/next-boilerplate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Auth: GitHub OAuth, passwordless magic links, demo sign-in, encrypted iron-session cookies, team invites by token","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uday-a/next-boilerplate/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> ### Powered by UIPKGE > > Every UI element, block and chart in this repo comes from the @uipkge-react registry — a shadcn/ui-compatible React distribution that covers the whole shape of a